# Naming Conventions

- Use **kebab-case** for all file names (components, hooks, utils, stores, data, etc.)
- Examples:
  - Components: `desktop.tsx`, `window.tsx`, `title-bar.tsx`, `window-controls.tsx`
  - Hooks: `use-window-drag.ts`, `use-window-resize.ts`, `use-url-sync.ts`
  - Utils: `window-utils.ts`, `viewport-constraints.ts`, `date-time.ts`
  - Stores: `window-store.ts`
  - Data: `windows.ts`
- This follows modern React conventions and improves file system compatibility across different platforms
- Always update imports when renaming files to maintain consistency